'''Pikachu & Friends''' is a collection of single-disc compilation DVDs by [[VIZ Media]] (distributed by Warner Home Video) that feature eight episodes of {{aniseries|PTS}} sourced from various seasons, each focusing on a specific Pokémon.

==Volumes==
==={{p|Pikachu}} & Friends===
[[File:Pikachu and Friends DVD cover.png|thumb|150px|Pikachu & Friends]]
Released on June 1, 2021, with the ISBN number 7-82009-24726-5. Optional English-language captioning is included.
